{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["<b>This time I will praise HaShem.</b> As in the sense of 'this time,' since I now have four sons — I will praise HaShem, for I will no longer desire to have more. As it says: I will praise HaShem, who has given me all this, and it suffices me. Therefore she ceased bearing."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:46:18.713891053Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}